    <summary><a href="/blog/posts/blog1/">Is this site mainly directed towards trans men?</a></summary>
    <ul>
      <li>Since I am ftm myself, I do tend to talk more about trans men's issues than trans women's issues. I talk about what I know. However, I've done my best to compile a decent list of resources that could be helpful for any tans person.</li>
      <li>If there are any resources or inclusions you think would benefit trans women or transfem people visiting my site, please feel free to conact me via guestbook or comment!</li>
       

</ul>
